  1f. THE PROTOCOL ON THE WIRE -- it is OSPF VERSION 2 (21:41:29, passive capture):

$ sudo timeout 25 tcpdump -i eth3 -n -v -c 2 'proto ospf'
  21:41:29.185373 IP (tos 0xc0, ttl 1, id 10382, offset 0, flags [DF], proto OSPF (89), length 64)
      192.168.10.1 > 224.0.0.5: OSPFv2, Hello, length 44
