    21:43:34 (+7 s)  O 10.90.90.1/32 [110/2] via 10.0.41.2, vlan41, 00:04:13
                     <-- 10.70.70.1/32 ALREADY GONE. Withdrawn in under 7 s.
    identical at 21:43:35, :39, :43, :47, :51. 10.90.90.1/32's age keeps ticking
    (00:04:13 -> 00:04:30), so it was never re-learned or disturbed -- only the
    withdrawn prefix moved.

