  3.3.3.3   1  Full/DR  00:00:33  10.0.41.2  vlan41
  2.2.2.2   1  Full/DR  00:00:32  10.0.61.2  vlan61
                                           <-- the adjacency to swi_b is STILL Full. The
                                               route went away because the ADVERTISEMENT
