awplus# show ip ospf database
  Link ID    ADV Router   Age  Seq#        CkSum   Link count
  2.2.2.2    2.2.2.2       43  0x80000005  0x5557  1    <-- was Seq 0x80000004, Link count 2
  3.3.3.3    3.3.3.3      296  0x80000004  0x2cd0  2    <-- untouched, age still climbing

