  vlan50 This means that the network associated with this interface can be advertised
  into OSPF using the network command, but no OSPF protocol packets will be sent out of
  this interface."
  Two separate claims, and the host NIC on vlan10 lets both be measured directly.

  4a. BEFORE. OSPF packets on eth3: one Hello every ~11 s (STEP 1f: 21:41:29.185 and
      21:41:40.188). swi_b's view of the DUT's vlan10 network (21:49:53):

